---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Composer from "../components/Composer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Investigate a claim"
  ><div class="workspace">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <div class="eyebrow">FOLLOW THE EVIDENCE</div><h1>
        A claim is a starting point.<br />Not a conclusion.
      </h1><p class="lede">
        Paste a statement, public link or copied text. KEO compares available
        evidence and makes the gaps visible.
      </p>
    </header><Composer mode="investigate" /><p class="small muted">
      Use “Add article or image URL” to read supported public links. Pasting a
      URL as the claim does not import its contents.{" "}
      <a href="/verify/">Open the screenshot workspace →</a>
    </p><section class="panel" style="margin-top:32px">
      <h2>What an assessment means</h2><p class="small muted">
        Supported and likely supported require evidence. Misleading means
        important context is missing. Unsupported means the checked evidence
        does not support the claim. False requires contradictory evidence.
        Unverified and insufficient evidence never mean false.
      </p><a class="small" href="/about/">Read the evidence standard →</a>
    </section>
  </div></Layout
>
